    "title": "7 Charged in Deadly Crash-and-Grab Robbery in Chicago's Magnificent Mile Shopping District - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Warner Todd Huston ,\n6 hours ago Seven men were charged for a deadly burglary on Chicago’s “Magnificent Mile,” the city’s main downtown shopping and tourist district. Prosecutors say the men used a pickup truck to smash into a Louis Vuitton store on Michigan Avenue just before 5 a.m. on Thursday, Sept 11. The men looted the store, and fled in several other vehicles, leaving the truck among the ruins of the storefront, according to Patch. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 48",
